# Around the Markoff uniqueness conjecture: manuscripts and reproduction
# material.
#
# Authors:
#   Dr. Denys Dutykh (Mathematics Department, Khalifa University of Science
#   and Technology, Abu Dhabi, UAE)
#   Prof. Laurent Vuillon (Univ. Savoie Mont Blanc, CNRS, LAMA, Chambery,
#   France)
#
# Ignore rules for the LaTeX builds and the Python supplements of every
# manuscript below papers/. No pattern is anchored, so each applies at any
# depth. The compiled manuscript PDFs are tracked on purpose, so there is
# deliberately no *.pdf rule below.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX and latexmk build artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.auxlock
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.dvi
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.out
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.xdv

# TikZ externalisation
*.figlist
*.makefile
*.md5

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python certificate supplement
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operating system and editor cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
*.bak
.idea/
.vscode/
